1️⃣ HEAP — THE CORE IDEA 🏔️

A Heap is a complete binary tree that follows a heap property.

Min Heap

Smallest element at the root.

2
       / \
      5   3
     / \
    8   7

Max Heap

Largest element at the root.

10
       /  \
      7    8
     / \
    2   5

🧠 Remember

Min Heap → Minimum on top
Max Heap → Maximum on top


---

2️⃣ Heap vs BST ⭐⭐⭐

Heap	BST

Complete binary tree	Ordered binary tree
Root gives min/max	Root doesn't necessarily give min/max
Great for priority	Great for ordered searching
Not fully sorted	Maintains ordering
Used in Priority Queue	Used for searching


🔥 Heap is NOT a sorted tree.


