6️⃣ PRIORITY QUEUE ⭐⭐⭐

A priority queue removes elements based on priority, not simply insertion order.

Example:

Emergency Room 🏥

Critical patient → treated first
Normal patient   → treated later

Heap is commonly used to implement a priority queue efficiently.


