1️⃣5️⃣ ACTIVITY SELECTION ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Given activities:

Activity | Start | Finish
A        | 1     | 3
B        | 2     | 5
C        | 4     | 6
D        | 6     | 7

Goal:

> Select the maximum number of non-overlapping activities.



Greedy Strategy:

Choose the activity that finishes earliest.

Sort by finish time:

A → B → C → D

Choose:

A → C → D

Answer:

\[
\boxed{3}
\]

🔥 Pattern

> Activity selection → Sort by finishing time




